ng with the holtzman engines which  fold space to basically navigate across  the universe and no one else knows how  to do it without computers and computers  are banned so the guild has a monopoly  on space travel and they work as  partners to chong  so if chome is the delivery company  amazon then  think of the guild as fedex or the  postal service  but also think of them as like every  airline  because they handle all of the traveling  in the universe now the great houses of  the lands rat all wield varying amounts  of power house carino the imperial house  is obviously very very wealthy because  they are the imperial house but they  also train very efficient very skilled  fighters known as the sardi car on their  prison planet solution secundus and this  basically keeps everyone in check no one  wants to face the wrath of the star to  car  now even though the emperor does have  wealth and does have strength he is  jealous of the rising power of house  atreides it's just the philosophy of  house atreides that breeds loyalty and  they're becoming more popular in the  lands rat and there's rumors that  atreides soldiers rival even the  emperor's sardocar there's also a feud  that's been going on between  specifically house of treaties and house  harkonnen that's been happening for  several generations  now underneath the front-facing politics  of the imperium the emperor the landsrad  chome company the guild the rivalries  between the great houses there is the  bini jesuit sisterhood now though the  many desert sisterhood only claims to  live to serve they are the secret rulers  of the imperium and they do so just by  operating from the shadows and they have  very manipulative techniques essentially  they operate under the guise of a  religious organization but they use this  in order to infiltrate worlds  governments and all sorts of systems so  that they can manipulate the people to  their own ends and they sometimes do  this hundreds of years in advance just  in case as was the case with a racket  the vinnie jesuit have also been  secretly crossing bloodlines for  generations essentially the great houses  of the lands rat exist as a pool of  genes for the benny jesuit to pick from  whenever they need many of the  characters we see in the series  including jessica the baron potentially  even duke latel himself are products of  the bini jesuit breeding program  the world arachus also called the planet  dune is at the center of all of this  because it is the only place where the  spice melange is produced now spice is a  mysterious psychoactive chemical that's  found in the deep desert that extends  life it heightens awareness and in  certain special individuals it can open  prescient site so you can think of spice  as a metaphor for oil but just add on  the fact that it's also a substance that  makes you live up to twice as long and  heightens your awareness and there is  the added fact that spice is so  addictive that once you become addicted  you can't stop taking it otherwise you  will die  so not only is spice essential to  commerce and traveling in the universe  there's also countless rich people  throughout the imperium that are  addicted to spice and without it they  would die that said you can understand  the significance of why arrakis is at  the center of imperial politics and why  it is so essential to the imperium that  arrakis remain a desert and that the  ecological transformation not go through  you can kind of think of dune as a  complicated drawn out chess game between  the emperor the mini jesuit the lanzerad  the guild and chong company i hope this  helps explain the politics of dune a  little bit better thanks guys for  listening peace out  you
 

